  1. Influenza - Diagnosis (SNOMED) (Condition)
     Intent: All clinical diagnosis codes for influenza (seasonal and specific subtypes) to identify recorded influenza diagnoses. Include generic influenza, influenza A, influenza B, avian/swine/pandemic influenza, and influenza with complications (e.g., pneumonia).
     Queries: influenza, influenza A, influenza B...
  2. Influenza - Molecular/NAAT/PCR tests (LOINC) (Measurement)
     Intent: LOINC measurement codes for molecular assays that detect influenza viral RNA/DNA (PCR, rRT-PCR, NAAT). Include tests for Influenza A, Influenza B, Influenza A/B panels and specific viral RNA qualitative/quantitative tests.
