  3. Influenza - Antigen detection / Rapid tests (LOINC) (Measurement)
     Intent: LOINC measurement codes for antigen detection tests including rapid influenza diagnostic tests (RIDT), immunoassays, immunofluorescence for Influenza A and B and combined A/B antigen detection.
     Queries: influenza antigen, influenza A antigen, influenza B antigen...
  4. Influenza - Viral culture tests (LOINC) (Measurement)
     Intent: LOINC measurement codes for viral culture and isolation tests for influenza viruses (Influenza A, Influenza B, and unspecified influenza virus culture/identification).
     Queries: influenza culture, influenza virus culture, influenza A culture...
  5. Influenza test positive / detected - Result value concepts (SNOMED) (Measurement)
